- `agent.md` - compatibility entrypoint that points to `AGENTS.md`
- `docs/` - guides and reference docs
- `src/` - implementation
- `config/` - configuration
- `context.md` / `WORKSPACE_CONTEXT.md` - generated repo/workspace guidance

